  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Constructing employment in Northern Benin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to enable unemployed vulnerable youth in Northern Benin to gain work experience and find decent work through internships and a job placement programme. Invest International&#x2019;s project of construction of drinking water infrastructure in six towns in northern Benin will be used to offer these youth the opportunity to gain work experience in construction work and potentially a lasting job. Youth will receive practical skills trainings so that they can be employed in the construction of drinking water facilities in six towns in northern Benin.</narrative>
  </description>
